+* the writers: `MSTORE8`, `CODECOPY`, `RETURNDATACOPY`, `MCOPY` (beside `mstore_run_memory` and
   `calldatacopy_run_memory` in `Blanc/Lift/MemMap.lean`), and the output windows of `CALL`,
